  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n**(98)/(56)** of **((63)/(7)+(35)/(5))div(7)/(49)** = ?\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nBODMAS Rule\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n(98)/(56) of ((63)/(7)+(35)/(5))div(7)/(49)\n\n⇒ (7)/(4) of (9+7)div(1)/(7)\n\n⇒ (7)/(4) of 16 div (1)/(7)\n\n⇒ 28 div (1)/(7)\n\n⇒ ? = 28 times 7\n\n⇒ ? = 196\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (2).**",
